@startuml RFID Detection and Live Frontend Update
title RFID Detection and Live Frontend Update

actor "RFID Tag" as Tag
participant "Checkpoint Node\n(ESP32 Firmware)" as Node
participant "MQTT Broker" as MQTT
participant "Backend MQTT Handler" as Backend
participant "Asset Location Service" as Location
database "PostgreSQL Database" as DB
participant "WebSocket Manager" as WS
participant "Registration App" as RegApp
participant "Monitor App" as MonApp

Tag -> Node: Tag enters RFID range
Node -> Node: Read tag ID
Node -> MQTT: Publish RFID detection\n(tag_id, device_id, timestamp)
MQTT -> Backend: Deliver detection message

Backend -> Backend: Parse MQTT payload
Backend -> Location: update_asset_location(tag_id, device_id)
Location -> DB: Find node by device_id
DB --> Location: Node data
Location -> DB: Find asset by tag_id
DB --> Location: Asset data

alt Valid node and registered active asset
    Location -> Location: Resolve flow status\navailable / wrong_location / in_transit
    Location -> DB: Save latest room, node, status, timestamp
    DB --> Location: Commit success
    Location --> Backend: Updated asset
    Backend -> WS: Broadcast asset_updated
    WS -> RegApp: Send asset_updated
    WS -> MonApp: Send asset_updated
    RegApp -> RegApp: Update asset table without refresh
    MonApp -> MonApp: Update monitor table without refresh
else Unknown tag
    Location --> Backend: Unknown tag
    Backend -> WS: Broadcast unknown_tag alert
    WS -> MonApp: Show alert
else Unknown or disabled node
    Location --> Backend: Invalid node detection
    Backend -> WS: Broadcast unknown_node_detection
    WS -> MonApp: Show node warning
end

@enduml